{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>DISCLAMER: All the content in this DLC is unstable and likely to bug, crash, or softlock.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouthwashing released one year ago today! It got us here at Wrong Organ feeling a little nostalgic. So much so that we started playing some old builds of our game.\u00a0Most weren't even playable - broken or bugged in some horrible way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However we did find some that were just barely playable enough to share with our community, and so we did. Now you can suffer as we have, and see what Mouthwashing looked like more than a year before launch. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contained within are three builds:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first playable version of the whole game ever uploaded to Steam</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The official demo</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A really old version of that demo</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4014000?t=1758909439","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014000/e1f31bb3797da1da6fd3c0f28c963d389ed83bdc/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758909439","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014000/1979421c88da68e039c01364048c7e74c29e8566/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758909439","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014000/1979421c88da68e039c01364048c7e74c29e8566/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758909439","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Most of the same mature themes of Mouthwashing are lightly present in these old versions.\r\n\r\nYou'll see Curly who's still pretty gore-y though."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>DISCLAMER: All the content in this DLC is unstable and likely to bug, crash, or softlock.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouthwashing released one year ago today! It got us here at Wrong Organ feeling a little nostalgic. So much so that we started playing some old builds of our game.\u00a0Most weren't even playable - broken or bugged in some horrible way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However we did find some that were just barely playable enough to share with our community, and so we did. Now you can suffer as we have, and see what Mouthwashing looked like more than a year before launch. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contained within are three builds:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first playable version of the whole game ever uploaded to Steam</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The official demo</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A really old version of that demo</p></li></ul>","developers":["Wrong Organ"],"fullgame":{"appid":"2475490","name":"Mouthwashing"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014000/7cbee290e0818b0ca2e13c4f5a08f05a2097c2c0/header.jpg?t=1758909439","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Mouthwashing - Work In Progress","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":[],"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":[" CRITICAL REFLEX"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"0","rating_generated":"1","required_age"